The weight files in this directory are converted to FP16 from the official Real-ESRGAN
checkpoints (https://github.com/xinntao/Real-ESRGAN) with scripts/convert-realesr-weights.py:

  realesr-animevideov3.f16.bin        realesr-animevideov3.pth, release v0.2.5.0 (SRVGGNetCompact)
                                      SHA-256 b8a8376811077954d82ca3fcf476f1ac3da3e8a68a4f4d71363008000a18b75d
  realesrgan-x4plus-anime-6b.f16.bin  RealESRGAN_x4plus_anime_6B.pth, release v0.2.2.4 (RRDBNet)
                                      SHA-256 f872d837d3c90ed2e05227bed711af5671a6fd1c9f7d7e91c911a61f155e99da

The weights are redistributed under the license of that project, reproduced below. The WGSL
implementation in this directory is part of this repository.

